      "side": 1,
      "message": "That does help making the variable name self explanatory, but the reason we need this variable for is to set the DT property `avf,new-instance` which cannot be changed within the scope of this work (since that would be boot protocol change between pvmfw/payload).\n\nSo I\u0027d prefer the variable name to match the property name. Thanks",
